(5858103, 852568, 66515, '<td valign="top">Tough scene to shoot: Dark shadows and bright snow.  Its also a tough subject to shoot. Not sure what angle to get this at. Perhaps a lower, more oblique angle?</td>', 'Tough scene to shoot: Dark shadows and bright snow.  Its also a tough subject to shoot. Not sure what angle to get this at. Perhaps a lower, more oblique angle?', '2010-02-08 00:44:24.000000', NULL, 1),
