(5858134, 852540, 17507, '<td valign="top">Awesome! I''m always delighted to see how landscapes can fit into a challenge. (No, really, I''m the biggest sucker for landscapes and I''d probably enter them in every challenge if I could.) I''m surprised you didn''t clone out the light post. That''s my only nitpick, thought--this works very well photographically, and it fits the challenge well, too.</td>', 'Awesome! I''m always delighted to see how landscapes can fit into a challenge. (No, really, I''m the biggest sucker for landscapes and I''d probably enter them in every challenge if I could.) I''m surprised you didn''t clone out the light post. That''s my only nitpick, thought--this works very well photographically, and it fits the challenge well, too.', '2010-02-08 00:56:30.000000', NULL, 1),
