(5858142, 852635, 17507, '<td valign="top">Holy goodness! I hope this photoshoot didn''t take too long!<br/> <br/>Wish you''d knocked out that branch in the middle of the photo... nice choice of color for the model''s apparel.</td>', 'Holy goodness! I hope this photoshoot didn''t take too long! Wish you''d knocked out that branch in the middle of the photo... nice choice of color for the model''s apparel.', '2010-02-08 00:59:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(5858150, 852747, 17507, '<td valign="top">Nice gentle lighting. Window light? Looks like the work of AJHopp.</td>', 'Nice gentle lighting. Window light? Looks like the work of AJHopp.', '2010-02-08 01:00:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(5858154, 852545, 17507, '<td valign="top">Hear, hear!<br/> <br/>This photo definitely meets the challenge and is conceptually strong. Its greatest weakness is the flat lighting. I don''t know what kind of equipment you have, but I''ve found that a $30 worklight bounced off something large and white can work wonders...</td>', 'Hear, hear! This photo definitely meets the challenge and is conceptually strong. Its greatest weakness is the flat lighting. I don''t know what kind of equipment you have, but I''ve found that a $30 worklight bounced off something large and white can work wonders...', '2010-02-08 01:02:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(5858160, 852754, 17507, '<td valign="top">Love the grit. I gather the plant is meant to symbolize hope? It took me a minute to make that connection--would have liked to see the plant figure a little more prominently in the composition if it''s to be conceptually half of the photo (as judged by the title). Possibly dragging out the end table/crate from the wall a bit would have been enough.</td>', 'Love the grit. I gather the plant is meant to symbolize hope? It took me a minute to make that connection--would have liked to see the plant figure a little more prominently in the composition if it''s to be conceptually half of the photo (as judged by the title). Possibly dragging out the end table/crate from the wall a bit would have been enough.', '2010-02-08 01:04:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(5858164, 851457, 17507, '<td valign="top">The face appears weirdly smooth, which perhaps is all the weirder for the face/hands/hat being the only sharp parts of the photo.</td>', 'The face appears weirdly smooth, which perhaps is all the weirder for the face/hands/hat being the only sharp parts of the photo.', '2010-02-08 01:06:19.000000', NULL, 1),
