(5858171, 852518, 17507, '<td valign="top">Great pose and lighting. I like the composition, except for the inclusion of the chair legs--all the action is happening in the top 3/4 of the photo. I don''t think you would have lost anything (in terms of the challenge or otherwise) by cropping them out. Hard to know without seeing it, but that''s my instinctive reaction.</td>', 'Great pose and lighting. I like the composition, except for the inclusion of the chair legs--all the action is happening in the top 3/4 of the photo. I don''t think you would have lost anything (in terms of the challenge or otherwise) by cropping them out. Hard to know without seeing it, but that''s my instinctive reaction.', '2010-02-08 01:08:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(5858172, 852702, 66515, '<td valign="top">Really needs to be lightened on the bottom of the image below the horizon. I find this quite dark.</td>', 'Really needs to be lightened on the bottom of the image below the horizon. I find this quite dark.', '2010-02-08 01:09:05.000000', NULL, 1),
