(5859907, 852425, 66515, '<td valign="top">Love the warm tones and "earthy" feel to this image. Not sure what you did for processing but its just right in my books. At first the light coming through the back/side of the barn might be considered to be blow highlights but  I see it was an interesting way of incorporating the sun in the image. <br/> <br/>The leading lines of the wall lead right to our chairs which of course is key in this challenge. <br/> <br/>Great job!</td>', 'Love the warm tones and "earthy" feel to this image. Not sure what you did for processing but its just right in my books. At first the light coming through the back/side of the barn might be considered to be blow highlights but  I see it was an interesting way of incorporating the sun in the image.  The leading lines of the wall lead right to our chairs which of course is key in this challenge.  Great job!', '2010-02-08 22:14:28.000000', NULL, 1),
