(5863297, 852694, 83313, '<td valign="top">I see lots of blocky compression artifacts in this image. Most evident around the glasses and the top of the chair. Your file size of only 50k confirms the use of excessive JPEG compression. Compression kills detail and creates artifacts. Always adjust JPEG compression so that your file size is as large as possible, but within the challenge limit.<br/> <br/>Aside from that, it''s a good shot with good lighting.</td>', 'I see lots of blocky compression artifacts in this image. Most evident around the glasses and the top of the chair. Your file size of only 50k confirms the use of excessive JPEG compression. Compression kills detail and creates artifacts. Always adjust JPEG compression so that your file size is as large as possible, but within the challenge limit. Aside from that, it''s a good shot with good lighting.', '2010-02-11 13:28:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(5863301, 851595, 83313, '<td valign="top">I guess throwing furniture would be preferable to my approach of throwing my camera at the floor. Gone through a Rebel Xt and a 20D recently. I''ll try your method and see if it is as satisfying.</td>', 'I guess throwing furniture would be preferable to my approach of throwing my camera at the floor. Gone through a Rebel Xt and a 20D recently. I''ll try your method and see if it is as satisfying.', '2010-02-11 13:30:31.000000', NULL, 1),
