(5866915, 852720, 76335, '<td valign="top">This is an odd one. I see a chair -- and lots more. I''m having trouble giving this a low score...</td>', 'This is an odd one. I see a chair -- and lots more. I''m having trouble giving this a low score...', '2010-02-14 21:11:07.000000', NULL, 1),
