(5866918, 852666, 76335, '<td valign="top">Yes! The lighting works so well with these textures.</td>', 'Yes! The lighting works so well with these textures.', '2010-02-14 21:11:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(5866919, 852744, 76335, '<td valign="top">Fabulous POV. The arrow nails it for me.</td>', 'Fabulous POV. The arrow nails it for me.', '2010-02-14 21:11:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(5866920, 851844, 76335, '<td valign="top">It''s almost more about her than the chair -- except for the fact that the chair is oozing its entrails off to the side there. This is interesting, because it seems to echo your model''s own flowing hair (almost typed entrails). <br/> <br/>I love the location you chose for this, and hope you share something about where and how this came about.</td>', 'It''s almost more about her than the chair -- except for the fact that the chair is oozing its entrails off to the side there. This is interesting, because it seems to echo your model''s own flowing hair (almost typed entrails).  I love the location you chose for this, and hope you share something about where and how this came about.', '2010-02-14 21:11:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(5866921, 852029, 76335, '<td valign="top">What''s going on on the floor there? One of his victims? <br/> <br/>Creepy...</td>', 'What''s going on on the floor there? One of his victims?  Creepy...', '2010-02-14 21:11:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(5866922, 851896, 76335, '<td valign="top">If you tampered with or "posed" the scene, I don''t get that feeling (and would rahter not know). It has the feeling that it was found in this position. I''m a sucker for black and white, and so I wonder how this would have looked as such, but it still works very well.</td>', 'If you tampered with or "posed" the scene, I don''t get that feeling (and would rahter not know). It has the feeling that it was found in this position. I''m a sucker for black and white, and so I wonder how this would have looked as such, but it still works very well.', '2010-02-14 21:11:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(5866923, 852229, 76335, '<td valign="top">Park benches in wintertime are wonderful things. They always convey a sense of both loss and anticipation -- a dichotomy of sorts. The couple walking away adds good counterpoint. Nice mid-key conversion here too -- I''m happy not to see heavy-handed contrast adjustment on this.</td>', 'Park benches in wintertime are wonderful things. They always convey a sense of both loss and anticipation -- a dichotomy of sorts. The couple walking away adds good counterpoint. Nice mid-key conversion here too -- I''m happy not to see heavy-handed contrast adjustment on this.', '2010-02-14 21:11:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(5866924, 852481, 76335, '<td valign="top">Sharp focus is overrated. Good for you.</td>', 'Sharp focus is overrated. Good for you.', '2010-02-14 21:11:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(5866925, 852210, 76335, '<td valign="top">I like the tight framing that keeps the eye on the dilapidated shapes and weathered, time-worn textures. Sepia looks good too.</td>', 'I like the tight framing that keeps the eye on the dilapidated shapes and weathered, time-worn textures. Sepia looks good too.', '2010-02-14 21:11:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(5866926, 852735, 76335, '<td valign="top">This is fabulous! Feels like too much Topaz for my taste, but absolutely love how you composed this. Good lines and shapes, and use of DOF to show them off.</td>', 'This is fabulous! Feels like too much Topaz for my taste, but absolutely love how you composed this. Good lines and shapes, and use of DOF to show them off.', '2010-02-14 21:11:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(5866927, 852398, 76335, '<td valign="top">Looks like a great seat indeed. Stunning. Nice contrast, mood...</td>', 'Looks like a great seat indeed. Stunning. Nice contrast, mood...', '2010-02-14 21:11:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(5866929, 852540, 76335, '<td valign="top">Love it and the title nails it. (What''s the horizontal line in the sky?)</td>', 'Love it and the title nails it. (What''s the horizontal line in the sky?)', '2010-02-14 21:11:48.000000', NULL, 1),
