(5866979, 852695, 50695, '<td valign="top">I love starlings. I have a feeling your score is doing well because of the attention to style here, but I''m giving you a ribbon anyway, because it''s a truly beautiful image. And I love starlings. They''re almost as good as crows.<br/> <br/>Posthumous Red Ribbon. <img alt="'' . substr(''//blackyak.com/dpc/redpost.jpg'', strrpos(''//blackyak.com/dpc/redpost.jpg'', ''/'') + 1) . ''" border="0" src="//blackyak.com/dpc/redpost.jpg"/></td>', 'I love starlings. I have a feeling your score is doing well because of the attention to style here, but I''m giving you a ribbon anyway, because it''s a truly beautiful image. And I love starlings. They''re almost as good as crows. Posthumous Red Ribbon. ', '2010-02-14 22:23:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(5866981, 852700, 50695, '<td valign="top">Fascinating image. I feel like clawing it. Posthumous Yellow Ribbon.<br/> <br/><img alt="'' . substr(''//blackyak.com/dpc/yellowpost.jpg'', strrpos(''//blackyak.com/dpc/yellowpost.jpg'', ''/'') + 1) . ''" border="0" src="//blackyak.com/dpc/yellowpost.jpg"/></td>', 'Fascinating image. I feel like clawing it. Posthumous Yellow Ribbon. ', '2010-02-14 22:24:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(5866982, 852489, 50695, '<td valign="top">I feel almost too compelled to give this a ribbon, like I''m supposed to because it''s blurry, but it''s an interesting photo, doesn''t give everything away like so many photos do, and I have a fondness for folding chairs. So, Posthumous Blue Ribbon for you.<br/> <br/><img alt="'' . substr(''//blackyak.com/dpc/bluepost.jpg'', strrpos(''//blackyak.com/dpc/bluepost.jpg'', ''/'') + 1) . ''" border="0" src="//blackyak.com/dpc/bluepost.jpg"/></td>', 'I feel almost too compelled to give this a ribbon, like I''m supposed to because it''s blurry, but it''s an interesting photo, doesn''t give everything away like so many photos do, and I have a fondness for folding chairs. So, Posthumous Blue Ribbon for you. ', '2010-02-14 22:24:31.000000', NULL, 1),
