(5867260, 852054, 114285, '<td valign="top">Thanks to all that commented, this was suppose to have the soft focus effect, to me it was''nt out of focus, but I see your point.<br/> <br/>lol yeah this is really bad!!!<br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2012-11-19 05:56:41.</i></td>', 'Thanks to all that commented, this was suppose to have the soft focus effect, to me it was''nt out of focus, but I see your point. lol yeah this is really bad!!!', '2010-02-15 01:29:54.000000', '2012-11-19 05:56:41.000000', 0),
(5867262, 852425, 47541, '<td valign="top">Greetings from the Critique Club.<br/> <br/><b>First impressions</b> are of the tones - they are great!<br/> <br/><b>Technically</b> this seems exposed well. The composition is good but everything seems on a slight lean. There are plenty of leading lines however they take us away from the chairs and off to the bright light through the boards.<br/> <br/><b>Artistically</b> there is plenty for us to look at here. I do feel that less of the surroundings and more of the cobweb covered chairs would have added to the appeal. The title is fine, don''t listen to them!<br/> <br/><b>In summary</b> a good shot (it did get a 6.4) but I think it could have easily been top 10 with some work.<br/> <br/>Feel free to <a href="//www.dpchallenge.com/messaging.php?action=compose&amp;USER_ID=47541" rel="nofollow" target="_blank">PM me</a> if you have any queries.<br/>Gerry</td>', 'Greetings from the Critique Club. First impressions are of the tones - they are great! Technically this seems exposed well. The composition is good but everything seems on a slight lean. There are plenty of leading lines however they take us away from the chairs and off to the bright light through the boards. Artistically there is plenty for us to look at here. I do feel that less of the surroundings and more of the cobweb covered chairs would have added to the appeal. The title is fine, don''t listen to them! In summary a good shot (it did get a 6.4) but I think it could have easily been top 10 with some work. Feel free to PM me if you have any queries.Gerry', '2010-02-15 01:33:36.000000', NULL, 0),
(5867325, 852500, 100393, '<td valign="top">Good to see you back in the game Alan; this has your stamp of ''wonderful execution'' all over it.</td>', 'Good to see you back in the game Alan; this has your stamp of ''wonderful execution'' all over it.', '2010-02-15 02:42:49.000000', NULL, 0),
(5867359, 852283, 105130, '<td valign="top">Man, it''s all or nothing with you, huh? Can''t bring yourself to win a humble red or yellow, it''s got to be blue or nothing?! :-)<br/> <br/>Parabéns meu, és mesmo uma máquina. Abraço.</td>', 'Man, it''s all or nothing with you, huh? Can''t bring yourself to win a humble red or yellow, it''s got to be blue or nothing?! :-) Parabéns meu, és mesmo uma máquina. Abraço.', '2010-02-15 03:10:12.000000', NULL, 0),
