(5867430, 852507, 105457, '<td valign="top">Now <u>THIS </u>is a great use for a fisheye lens!<br/>It''s just so hard to use it effectively, and this image with the title just brings it home!<br/>Would be a double winner also in the Perspective :)<br/> <br/>Congrats Neil, no vote below 4, awesome!</td>', 'Now THIS is a great use for a fisheye lens!It''s just so hard to use it effectively, and this image with the title just brings it home!Would be a double winner also in the Perspective :) Congrats Neil, no vote below 4, awesome!', '2010-02-15 04:10:10.000000', NULL, 0),
