(5867655, 852715, 61651, '<td valign="top">Seriously - I have two chairs in my image and you place 9 spots higher and nearly a 5.0??!!!!   ;)<br/> <br/>I thought when I first saw this that that was the idea - what the camera saw from a rocking chair - and that is a fantastic interpretation of a fairly boring challenge theme, frankly something I wish I had thought of.  I love the way the land overlaps itself, like there are trenches just off that porch.<br/> <br/>I apologize for robbing you.  :)</td>', 'Seriously - I have two chairs in my image and you place 9 spots higher and nearly a 5.0??!!!!   ;) I thought when I first saw this that that was the idea - what the camera saw from a rocking chair - and that is a fantastic interpretation of a fairly boring challenge theme, frankly something I wish I had thought of.  I love the way the land overlaps itself, like there are trenches just off that porch. I apologize for robbing you.  :)', '2010-02-15 08:52:11.000000', NULL, 0),
