(5867816, 852454, 86447, '<td valign="top">Well, at least you learned something here... Baby Puke Yellow... and that weird is good.<br/> <br/>I''ve come to terms with the latter long ago and am now okay with myself.  *grin*<br/> <br/>I LIKE the puke color... *grin again* and the image itself.  WELL DONE!<br/> <br/>Have you considered circus work?</td>', 'Well, at least you learned something here... Baby Puke Yellow... and that weird is good. I''ve come to terms with the latter long ago and am now okay with myself.  *grin* I LIKE the puke color... *grin again* and the image itself.  WELL DONE! Have you considered circus work?', '2010-02-15 11:09:44.000000', NULL, 0),
