(5889836, 851955, 101117, '<td valign="top">How could I pass up this one, once again an excellent example of lighting.<br/> <br/>There are two things about this that take it from being a good shot to a great one. The first is the apparent narrow beam of lights you have used to isolate the subject (I''m not sure if that''s what''s actually happening here but it looks that way) and the second, for me anyway, is the fact that''s it''s an old looking uninteresting chair that you have used, which for some reason just seems to give the shot that much more appeal.</td>', 'How could I pass up this one, once again an excellent example of lighting. There are two things about this that take it from being a good shot to a great one. The first is the apparent narrow beam of lights you have used to isolate the subject (I''m not sure if that''s what''s actually happening here but it looks that way) and the second, for me anyway, is the fact that''s it''s an old looking uninteresting chair that you have used, which for some reason just seems to give the shot that much more appeal.', '2010-03-04 06:18:12.000000', NULL, 0),
